sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Browser / Next.js
  participant CDN as CDN
  participant B as Backend (Fastify)
  participant P as TUS Proxy
  participant T as tusd (upload server)
  participant R as R2 / S3
  participant Q as Job Queue / Broker
  participant W as Worker (transcode/asr/export)
  participant F as FFmpeg
  participant DB as Postgres (Prisma)
  participant WS as LiveKit / WebSocket
  participant RED as Redis (cache)

  Note over C,B: Upload & Live session
  C->>B: Request presign / start session
  B->>WS: Issue LiveKit token / join
  C->>WS: Connect & publish media (LiveKit handles transport)
  WS-->>B: Recording segments / events (or webhooks)

  Note over C,P,T: Resumable upload flow
  C->>P: TUS upload (tus-js-client) -> /tus/*
  P->>T: Proxy bytes to `tusd`
  T->>R: Persist segments/blobs to R2/S3
  T->>B: POST /hooks/pre-create (tusd hook)
  B->>Q: Enqueue transcode job (recording created)

  Note over Q,W: Background processing
  Q-->>W: Worker picks job
  W->>R: Download segments/blobs
  W->>F: Run ffmpeg transcode/merge
  F-->>W: Emit final MP4/WEBM + thumbnails
  W->>R: Upload outputs to R2/S3
  W->>DB: Update recording metadata / status
  W->>RED: Write/update cache keys (optional)
  W->>Q: Enqueue ASR job / transcript job

  Note over W,DB,RED: ASR & transcripts
  W->>W: ASR -> produce transcript chunks
  W->>R: Store transcript files
  W->>DB: Persist transcript metadata
  W->>RED: Cache transcript chunks (optional)

  Note over C,B,CDN: Playback & UI
  C->>B: GET /recordings (list)
  alt cache hit
    B->>RED: GET cache
    RED-->>B: cached payload
    B-->>C: 200 JSON (cached)
  else cache miss
    B->>DB: Query recordings via Prisma
    B->>RED: SET cache (stale-while-revalidate)
    B-->>C: 200 JSON
  end
  C->>B: Request presigned URL for blob
  B->>R: Create presigned URL (short TTL)
  B-->>C: presigned URL
  C->>CDN: Fetch via CDN (edge cache)
  CDN->>R: Origin fetch if cache miss
  CDN-->>C: Serve content

  Note over RED,B: Invalidation
  W->>RED: Publish invalidation message (Pub/Sub)
  RED-->>B: Instances flush in-process caches
  W->>CDN: Purge or rely on versioned URLs for new blobs

  Note over all: Observability
  B->>DB: metrics/logs
  W->>DB: metrics/logs
  CDN->>B: logs
  B->>C: metrics endpoints for dashboards
